      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Migdal_HaEmek"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Before 1953, the site that became Migdal HaEmek was the Arab Palestinian village of al‑Mujaydil, existing since at least 1596.",
